# Vocal2Midi (vendored subset) — keep source + runtime libs, exclude weights
#
# Vendored from /mnt/d/Project/OpenSourceProject/Vocal2Midi (independent git
# repo there, history NOT carried over). Only the parts the V2M micro-service
# actually uses were migrated:
#   - inference/ + application/ code (qwen3asr_dml/bin keeps Linux .so only)
#   - experiments/{1218_hfa_model_new_dict, GAME-1.0.3-medium-onnx,
#     Qwen3-ASR-1.7B-dml} model dirs
# Excluded on purpose: .git history, RMVPE/romajiASR models, GUI/, *.bat,
# model-simplify.onnx, __pycache__, Windows dlls.

# ===== Python =====
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ===== Model weights (large, not committed — same policy as source repo) =====
*.onnx
*.gguf
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.h5
*.npy
*.npz
*.pkl
*.pickle

# NOTE: inference/qwen3asr_dml/bin/*.so ARE committed — they are the llama.cpp
# runtime the ASR worker dlopen()s at startup, part of the code not weights.
# The global *.so ignore from the source repo is deliberately NOT kept.

# ===== Audio / media =====
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac

# ===== Env / secrets =====
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ===== Editors / OS =====
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

.claude-flow/
